      "bottomRightY": 202,
      "content": "$$\\mathfrak{p} = \\sum_{k=1}^{f/3} \\mathfrak{p}_k; \\quad \\text{d. h.} \\quad \\mathfrak{p}_x = \\sum_{k=1}^{f/3} \\mathfrak{p}_{kx}, \\dots, \\quad (2)$$",
